uestro equipo, esperamos tu postulación! 👏', 0, 'Ituzaingó, Buenos Aires', 'Presencial', 'Full-time', '13-04-2026', '13-04-2026 13:38:57', '14-04-2026 09:33:47', '2026-04-13', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-13T00:00:00-03:00', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 6, 35, 1, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 70, 'Avisos Classic', 'zonajobs', 'zonajobs', 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.bumeran.com.ar/empleos/2179513.html', '2026-04-15T07:05:55.984465');
