mpresas/0/0/1/0/1/1/7/1/6/0/logoMainPic_10117160_bum_v9ea38437.jpg', 0, 0, NULL, 2001, 'Freemium', 'bumeran', 'freemium', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.bumeran.com.ar/empleos/1118230141.html', '2026-04-15T07:05:56.005376');
